            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Isocoma hartwegii is a Mexican plant species in the family Asteraceae. It has been found in the states of Jalisco, Zacatecas, Aguascalientes, Hidalgo, Guanajuato, and San Luis Potosí."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Isocoma hartwegii is a subshrub. Each flower head has 13-22 disc flowers but no ray flowers."
          }
        ]
